---
import metrics from '../data/metrics.json';
---

<section id="calidad" class="py-24 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Calidad del software</h2>
  <p class="text-transit-text-mid mb-12 text-lg max-w-3xl">
    Métricas objetivas de calidad extraídas del pipeline CI/CD y de la auditoría independiente del proyecto.
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-state-success text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.tests.passed}</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">tests pasando</p>
      <p class="text-transit-text-lo text-xs">{metrics.tests.skipped} skipped</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-accent text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.code.migrations}</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">migraciones SQL</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-state-info text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.code.edgeFunctions}</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">Edge Functions</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-state-warning text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.code.features}</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">features</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-text-hi text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.code.ciJobs}</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">CI jobs verde</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-transit-bg-surface p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transit-bg-raised text-center">
      <div class="text-transit-state-success text-4xl font-bold font-mono">{metrics.scorecard.tfg}/10</div>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mt-2">scorecard TFG</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 bg-transit-accent-bg border border-transit-accent/20 rounded-2xl p-6">
    <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm">
      Cobertura de tests: <span class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono font-bold">{metrics.coverage.global}%</span> (objetivo {metrics.coverage.target}%).
      Scorecard producción: <span class="text-transit-text-hi font-mono font-bold">{metrics.scorecard.production}/10</span>.
      La auditoría independiente del 2026-05-22 destaca "arquitectura sólida, documentación exhaustiva y pipeline CI/CD maduro".
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
